{
  "name": "Bookland CreatorOps | Music demo (template)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Bookland | New Music demo",
        "formDescription": "Enter a Bookland brand brief and one Music angle. A draft is generated for human approval. No render or social publication happens before approval.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Brand config JSON",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "placeholder": "{\"name\":\"Bookland\",\"voice\":\"energetic\",\"audience\":\"Mac users\",\"cta\":\"COMMENT BOOKLAND\"}",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Topic",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "path": "creatorops-video-pipeline",
          "respondWithOptions": {
            "values": {
              "formSubmittedText": "Received. The draft is saved in the data table \"creatorops_video_drafts\" with an approval_url. Nothing is rendered or published until it is approved."
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "260db539-6454-4801-801b-9ddd847b8f0f",
      "name": "Submit Brand Config + Topic",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        0,
        96
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "run_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $execution.id }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "topic",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.Topic }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "brand",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json[\"Brand config JSON\"]) }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "brand_name",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json[\"Brand config JSON\"]).name || \"Unnamed brand\" }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "14385454-a048-47ee-b617-7fed09cf080b",
      "name": "Parse Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        272,
        224
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Brand config (JSON):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.brand) }}\n\nTopic angle: {{ $json.topic }}\n\nCreate a 22-second English package for the fixed BooklandMusicReal composition. It uses recorded Bookland footage only: 0–4s problem, 4–8s real hover opening beside the MacBook camera, 8–16s the same recorded YouTube session seeking back 15 seconds (00:45 to 00:30), 16–18s real island collapse, 18–22s Bookland logo and CTA. Do not invent shots or claim other features appear in this film. Bookland is free, open source, and currently for Apple Silicon Macs on macOS 26+.\n\nGenerate three different short hooks; choose one with a clear pain point in the first two seconds. script.hook is at most six short words, script.body at most one short line, script.cta exactly COMMENT\\nBOOKLAND, and script.duration_seconds is 22. Keep voiceover around 45–55 words with a human, energetic delivery. Make Instagram and TikTok captions distinct, truthful, and focused on one action: comment BOOKLAND for the link. Do not promise an automatic DM or paid features. Return only the required schema.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are a short-form video strategist for Bookland. Follow the brand config and output JSON schema exactly. Produce three distinct hooks, one 22-second English script with about 45-55 spoken words, and a 9:16 shot plan that covers 0-22 seconds with no gaps. The footage is fixed and real: hover opening, YouTube 15-second seek in one take, island collapse, and Bookland end card. Do not invent other footage, product features, testimonials, performance claims, or automated link delivery. Write distinct Instagram and TikTok captions with one ask: comment BOOKLAND for the link. Keep claims verifiable. Return only data matching the required JSON schema."
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "id": "7def0288-71a2-452d-b4f4-6882b4811c6a",
      "name": "Generate Video Package",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        496,
        224
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-6.1-sol",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-6.1-sol"
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "46b9f564-6d0f-4d0d-a193-d59283b2a54e",
      "name": "AI Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        512,
        448
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"required\": [\n    \"hooks\",\n    \"script\",\n    \"shot_plan\",\n    \"captions\"\n  ],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"hooks\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 3,\n      \"maxItems\": 3,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\n          \"text\",\n          \"style\"\n        ],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"text\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Hook line, max 12 words, spoken in the first 2 seconds\"\n          },\n          \"style\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"e.g. question, bold claim, pattern interrupt\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"script\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\n        \"language\",\n        \"duration_seconds\",\n        \"voiceover\",\n        \"on_screen_text\",\n        \"hook\",\n        \"body\",\n        \"cta\"\n      ],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"language\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"en\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"duration_seconds\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            22\n          ],\n          \"description\": \"The fixed recorded Music composition lasts 22 seconds\"\n        },\n        \"voiceover\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"English, about 45–55 words, only about real Bookland Music and the recorded YouTube seek\"\n        },\n        \"on_screen_text\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"hook\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"maxLength\": 50,\n          \"description\": \"Opening title, at most 6 short words\"\n        },\n        \"body\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"maxLength\": 70,\n          \"description\": \"Short on-screen line about the real 15-second seek\"\n        },\n        \"cta\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"COMMENT\\nBOOKLAND\"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"shot_plan\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"description\": \"9:16 timing for the five fixed real-footage scenes from 0–22 seconds: problem 0–4, hover 4–8, recorded seek 8–16, collapse 16–18, Bookland CTA 18–22. Do not invent new shots.\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\n          \"shot\",\n          \"start_s\",\n          \"end_s\",\n          \"aspect_ratio\",\n          \"visual\",\n          \"camera\",\n          \"on_screen_text\"\n        ],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"shot\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"start_s\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"end_s\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"aspect_ratio\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"9:16\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"visual\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"camera\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"on_screen_text\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"captions\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\n        \"instagram\",\n        \"tiktok\"\n      ],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"instagram\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"required\": [\n            \"caption\",\n            \"hashtags\"\n          ],\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"caption\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"hashtags\": {\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"tiktok\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"required\": [\n            \"caption\",\n            \"hashtags\"\n          ],\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"caption\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"description\": \"Max 150 characters before hashtags\"\n            },\n            \"hashtags\": {\n              \"type\": \"array\",\n              \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\"\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"
      },
